<!-- ============ 04 投入方式 ============ -->
<section class="py-[88px]" id="modes">
	<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-7">
		<div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[22px]" data-rv>
			<span class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.15em] text-amber">04 / 投入</span>
			<h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px)] font-black tracking-[.01em]">三种合作方式</h2>
			<span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint">// 不按小时计费，不做报价拉锯</span>
		</div>
		<p class="mb-11 max-w-[660px] text-[15px] leading-[2] text-sub" data-rv>对应合作的三个阶段。都从最小的一步开始——走不走得下去、走到哪一步，随时由你决定，每个阶段结束都是自然的退出点。</p>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[18px] desk:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-[18px] rounded-2xl border border-line2 bg-bg2 p-[30px_28px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1" data-rv>
				<span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-amber">$ git checkout -b mvp</span>
				<h3 class="font-serif text-[26px] font-black">MVP 冲刺</h3>
				<span class="-mt-[10px] font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-faint">2–4 周 · 按阶段一口价</span>
				<ul class="grid gap-[11px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.8] text-sub">
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">核心流程跑通，只做验证必须的功能</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">部署上线：域名、服务器、小程序审核</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">两轮修改：真实用户用完之后的调整</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">一页纸交接文档，写给三个月后的你</li>
				</ul>
				<div class="mt-auto border-t border-dashed border-line2 pt-4 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.85] text-faint">开工前范围和价格都锁定，没有隐性收费。适合「想法刚落地，想先试试水」。</div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-[18px] rounded-2xl border border-amber-d bg-bg2 p-[30px_28px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-amber" data-rv style="transition-delay:.1s">
				<span class="absolute -top-3 left-6 rounded-full bg-amber px-[13px] py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#1d1405]">80% 的合作在这里</span>
				<span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-amber">$ git merge --continue</span>
				<h3 class="font-serif text-[26px] font-black">长期同行</h3>
				<span class="-mt-[10px] font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-faint">按月 · 最短 3 个月 · 不押金</span>
				<ul class="grid gap-[11px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.8] text-sub">
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">每周都有可见的进展，不用追着问</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">需求随聊随排，不写文档不走流程</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">线上问题响应，服务器告警我盯着</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">每月一次数据复盘：什么该做、什么该砍</li>
				</ul>
				<div class="mt-auto border-t border-dashed border-line2 pt-4 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.85] text-faint">比养一个初级程序员便宜，比外包驻场靠谱——这是伙伴们的原话。适合「已有用户，要持续迭代」。</div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-[18px] rounded-2xl border border-line2 bg-bg2 p-[30px_28px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1" data-rv style="transition-delay:.2s">
				<span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-amber">$ git remote add 我们</span>
				<h3 class="font-serif text-[26px] font-black">深度合伙</h3>
				<span class="-mt-[10px] font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-faint">长期 · 用代码换少量股份</span>
				<ul class="grid gap-[11px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.8] text-sub">
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">我投入开发，你保留业务的全部主导权</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">不占工资，只在产品赚钱之后分成</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">仓库、账号、文档从第一天就在你名下</li>
					<li class="flex gap-[10px] before:shrink-0 before:font-mono before:text-green before:content-['+']">每年最多 1 个名额，聊透才谈</li>
				</ul>
				<div class="mt-auto border-t border-dashed border-line2 pt-4 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.85] text-faint">只投给「已经有人付费」的方向——空想法不换股份，这是底线。</div>
			</div>

		</div>

		<a class="group relative mt-[26px] flex items-center gap-[22px] rounded-2xl border border-line2 bg-bg2 p-[24px_28px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[2px] hover:border-amber-d hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.35)] before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:-left-px before:-top-px before:h-[22px] before:w-[22px] before:rounded-tl-[14px] before:border-l-2 before:border-t-2 before:border-amber-d before:transition-colors before:duration-200 after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:-bottom-px after:-right-px after:h-[22px] after:w-[22px] after:rounded-br-[14px] after:border-b-2 after:border-r-2 after:border-amber-d after:transition-colors after:duration-200 group-hover:before:border-amber group-hover:after:border-amber slim:flex-col slim:items-center slim:gap-[14px] slim:p-[26px_20px] slim:text-center" href="/pricing" data-rv aria-label="打开合作执行手册">
			<span class="grid h-[52px] w-[52px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-amber-d bg-bg font-mono text-[17px] font-bold text-amber after:h-[2px] after:w-2 after:animate-blink after:bg-amber after:content-['']" aria-hidden="true">❯_</span>
			<span class="mm-copy">
				<span class="mb-[7px] block font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[.04em] text-amber">$ man 合作执行手册</span>
				<h3 class="font-serif text-[19px] font-black">每种模式，怎么执行、怎么付钱、怎么退出？</h3>
				<p class="mt-[6px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.9] text-sub">周期、付款节点、报价逻辑、变更与退出条款——都摊开写在执行手册里，价格按手作坊来。</p>
			</span>
			<span class="ml-auto inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-amber-d bg-bg px-[18px] py-[10px] font-mono text-[13.5px] text-amber transition duration-200 group-hover:border-amber group-hover:bg-amber/10 slim:ml-0 slim:w-full slim:justify-center">查看合作执行手册
